    "description": "If you asked my younger self if they will ever be caught running , and the answer would have always been a staunch NOOOO! And yet here we are­ƒñ¬­ƒñ¬. People really change hey. ­ƒñ¬­ƒÿå­ƒñú­ƒÿÇ­ƒÿü­ƒÿä. I just started walking, and then one day i saw this guy running, and i also thought why not.­ƒÿü­ƒÿä . I was so tired after few seconds but something else kicked in as well, the joy of running. I do not think i will ever stop running if i am still able to..­ƒñ¬­ƒÿä­ƒÿüÔØñ´©Å­ƒñù. I just love it! It has became a lifestyle.",
